url: "https://sergeyshk.github.io/esTS/"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0.dev1
date-released: 2026-09-22
keywords:
  - spanish
  - nlp
  - text statistics
  - readability
  - lexical diversity
  - stylometry
  - corpus linguistics
abstract: "esTS computes text statistics for Spanish: basic counts, readability formulas, lexical diversity and sophistication, morphological, syntactic, cohesion, phonetic and style statistics, metre and rhyme, corpus measures and stylometry, with spaCy components, datasets and visualizations."
